# Battle text. Every line must be plain ASCII and at most 44 characters
# after slots are filled (tests/test_battle.py checks this).
# Slots: {name} {foe} {move} {item} {amount} {type}

[battle.start]
A wild {foe}! I got this.
{foe} wants to fight? Okay!
Stand back. {foe} is mine.
Oh no, a {foe}. Oh YES!
Battle mode: ON.
I have been training for this!
{foe}, you picked the wrong pet.
Let us dance, {foe}.
Eek! Okay. Brave face. Brave face.
Hi {foe}. Bye {foe}. Soon.
My antenna is tingling. Fight time!
You look squishy, {foe}.
I will not lose to a {foe}!
Ready when you are, partner.
Ooh, a {foe}. Can I keep it?
Look, a {foe}! Point me at it.
Fight! Fight! Fight!
I am small but I am FAST.
{foe} spotted. Engaging cuteness.
Tell me what to do, I trust you.
Do not worry, I bite. Gently.
A {foe} in our dungeon? Rude.
Let me at it! Let me at it!
This {foe} is going down.
Hold my snack. I got this.
Here we go again!
Whoa, a {foe}. Stay behind me.
My circuits are buzzing. Let us go!
{foe}! Prepare to be pinged!
Time to show off my moves.
Is that a {foe}? Ew. Fight it.
Battle! Finally something fun!

[battle.start.norm]
Just a plain {foe}. Easy. Probably.
A regular {foe}. No tricks, okay?
Normal type. Normal beating then.
Nothing fancy about you, {foe}.
Plain and simple. Like my lunch.
A basic {foe}. I am not basic.
You are so normal, {foe}. Boring!
No type tricks? Fair fight then.
Vanilla {foe}. I prefer cookies.
A plain fight. I can do plain.
Just a {foe}? Easy peasy.
No weakness, no strength. Fair.
A normal fight. I am ready.
Plain {foe}. Plain beating.
Let us keep it simple.

[battle.start.volt]
A VOLT {foe}! My fur is standing up.
Zappy {foe}. Do not touch my tail.
It crackles! I crackle back!
VOLT type. Careful, it bites hard.
Ow, the air hums. VOLT {foe}!
That {foe} is all charged up.
Sparks! I love sparks. Not these.
A live wire. Ground me, partner.
VOLT {foe}. Static meets static!
It is buzzing louder than me!
Watch out for its sparks!
A charged {foe}! Stay grounded.
It hums like a power line.
VOLT {foe}. Ouch already.
My pixels are frizzy!

[battle.start.data]
A DATA {foe}. Full of bad bytes.
Corrupted DATA! Zap it clean!
DATA type. VOLT and FIRE melt it.
