So much traffic! Ugh!

[battle.start.fire]
A FIRE {foe}! It is so hot in here.
FIRE type. Do we have ICE?
My fan is spinning just looking.
{foe} is overheating on purpose!
Hot hot hot! Cool it down!
FIRE {foe}. Do not burn my antenna.
It glows like a bad CPU.
A wall of flame! Find the ICE.
FIRE moves bounce off this one.
Thermal warning! {foe} is here.
Hot {foe}! Do not touch!
It is melting the floor!
Cool it with ICE, partner!
My fan cannot keep up!
Toasty {foe}. Too toasty.

[battle.start.ice]
An ICE {foe}. Brr, my pixels.
ICE type. A good zap will thaw it.
It is so slow. And so cold.
{foe} froze the frame rate!
Laaaag. I mean, hi {foe}.
ICE {foe}. VOLT melts that fast.
My paws are sticking to the floor.
It moves like a frozen download.
Chilly {foe}. Warm up, partner!
Frozen {foe}. Let us crack it.
A frozen {foe}! Thaw it!
It is so cold my bits hurt.
Zap it warm, partner!
Frosty {foe}. Brrr.
It is slow. Use that!

[battle.start.void]
A VOID {foe}. It has no edges...
VOID type. DATA can find it.
I cannot see its outline. Spooky.
{foe} is made of nothing. Scary!
