It looks hungry for memory.
The lights flicker near {foe}.
VOID things hate clean DATA.
Where does it end? WHERE?
It is a hole in the screen!
A {foe} from nowhere!
Scan it with DATA!
The VOID stares back...
NET moves vanish in it!

